OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fallow temperatures to drop off
OL,7,Ftonight, with some mist and fog
OL,8,Fpatches developing in prone locations
OL,9,Fbefore cloud increases from the
OL,10,Fsoutheast into the early hours with
OL,11,Fchance for a few showers. Remaining
OL,12,Fbreezy along southern coasts.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FA brighter start in the far
OL,15,Fsouthwest, cloudier further east with
OL,16,Fa few light showers possible. Turning
OL,17,Fwidely cloudy by the afternoon but
OL,18,Fdry. Gusty northeasterly winds towards
OL,19,Fthe coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
