OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Flargely cloudy picture over the next
OL,7,Ffew days with showers possible. These
OL,8,Fmost frequent and intense on Saturday.
OL,9,FWinds easing but feeling cooler under
OL,10,Fcloudy skies.
